      "message": "I would prefer separate CLs for watching SLP_S5 in the ADL/ICL power sequencing and for enabling S4 residency on the board specific code.\n\nAny potential revert would only be on the platform files to disable CONFIG_HOSTCMD_ESPI_VW_SLP_S5 and CONFIG_POWER_S4_RESIDENCY.\n\nAlso, is this a valid combination?\n    CONFIG_HOSTCMD_ESPI_VW_SLP_S5\u003dy\n    CONFIG_POWER_S4_RESIDENCY\u003dn\n\nThe S4 residency feature flag explicitly disallows this:\n    CONFIG_HOSTCMD_ESPI_VW_SLP_S5\u003dn\n    CONFIG_POWER_S4_RESIDENCY\u003dy",
